        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.19023">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2504.19023">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2504.19023">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
