        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Inferring</span> Questions from Programming Screenshots
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ahmed%2C+F">Faiz Ahmed</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tan%2C+X">Xuchen Tan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Adewole%2C+F">Folajinmi Adewole</a>, 
      
